，但该 Secret 实际上并不包含此 key。这直接导致 kubelet 在启动容器时无法获取必要的配置信息，从而抛出 `CreateContainerConfigError`（证据 #1, #5），并导致 Pod 一直卡在 `Pending` 状态（证据 #2, #6）。\n\n**待确认问题：**\n输入中未提供 Secret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 的实际内容事实，因此无法进一步确认该 Secret 中实际包含了哪些 key（仅根据报错逻辑推测可能存在 `available-key`），也无法解释为何 Secret 创建时未包含预期的 `unavailable-key`。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 22.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 59.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2: 59.2s (Evidence 48.8s, RCA 10.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 91.792, "metrics": {"run_id": "5f2b207e6d764e75", "mttr": {"value": "1.5m", "seconds": 91.79870343208313, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数"